      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** cold, fire, lightning  
      **Damage Immunities** poison  
      **Condition Immunities** poisoned  
      **Senses** darkvision 120 ft., Passive Perception 10  
      **Languages** Abyssal, Common  
      **Challenge** 1 (200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Magic Resistance.*** The quasit has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.

      ## Actions

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage, and the target has the ***Poisoned*** condition until the start of the quasit's next turn.

      ***Scare (1/Day).*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 10, one creature within 20 feet. *Failure:* The target has the ***Frightened*** condition. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically.

      ***Shape-Shift.*** The quasit shape-shifts to resemble a bat (***Speed*** 10 ft., Fly 40 ft.), a centipede (40 ft., Climb 40 ft.), or a toad (40 ft., Swim 40 ft.), or it returns to its true form. Its game statistics are the same in each form, except for its ***Speed***. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn't transformed.

      ***Invisibility.*** The quasit casts [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility) on itself, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability.

      At will: [Invisibility](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619116-invisibility)  

